  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. All nearby foes begin Bleeding for 5...13...15 seconds. For 30 seconds, this enchantment does nothing. When this enchantment ends, all nearby foes are Crippled for 3...7...8 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "使附近的所有敵人遭受「殘廢」病症 3～8 秒。而在接下來的 30 秒，此「加持」並無直接效果，但當此「加持」效果終止時，附近的所有敵人開始「流血」 5～15 秒。"
    },
